Hatch Pet

This project includes and modifies portions of OpenAI's curated hatch-pet
skill from https://github.com/openai/skills/tree/main/skills/.curated/hatch-pet,
using upstream commit c25113bf4c64c8dba6bfe61acf06051d79aa43f6 as the baseline.
The upstream work was made available under the Apache License, Version 2.0.

The upstream workflow predates this Build Week project. This repository's
Build Week contribution extends that baseline with a real-pet photo identity
contract, personality-aware motion guidance, Codex v2 8x11 packaging,
sixteen look directions, targeted repair workflows, stricter visual QA,
package verification, safe installation, tests, and a reference pet.

The following upstream-derived files were modified in this project:

- skill/hatch-pet/SKILL.md
- skill/hatch-pet/agents/openai.yaml
- skill/hatch-pet/references/animation-rows.md
- skill/hatch-pet/references/codex-pet-contract.md
- skill/hatch-pet/references/qa-rubric.md
- skill/hatch-pet/scripts/derive_running_left_from_running_right.py
- skill/hatch-pet/scripts/extract_strip_frames.py
- skill/hatch-pet/scripts/inspect_frames.py
- skill/hatch-pet/scripts/make_contact_sheet.py
- skill/hatch-pet/scripts/prepare_pet_run.py
- skill/hatch-pet/scripts/validate_atlas.py

The unmodified upstream-derived files remain covered by the same Apache-2.0
license included at skill/hatch-pet/LICENSE.txt.
